<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>BCUK Bot — Terms of Service</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <%- include('partials/pwa-head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <% if (user) { %><%- include('partials/nav') %><% } %>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Terms of Service</h2>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">✅</span><span class="card-label">Acceptance of these terms</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>By using the BCUK Bot Discord bot or this web dashboard, you agree to these terms. If you don't
            agree, please don't use the bot or the dashboard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">🤖</span><span class="card-label">What the service is</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>BCUK Bot is a community Discord bot with a companion web dashboard. Depending on what's enabled
            on your server, it can run chat commands, play sound effects (SFX), post stream notifications,
            drive a stream overlay, and integrate with a Stream Deck.</p>
          <p>The service is provided for the benefit of the Discord communities that use it, on a best-effort
            basis, free of charge.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">📐</span><span class="card-label">Acceptable use</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>Don't use the bot or dashboard to abuse, spam, or disrupt a Discord server, or to upload or
            trigger sound effects, custom commands, or other content that is illegal, infringes someone
            else's rights, or that you don't have permission to use.</p>
          <p>You're responsible for any content you add through custom commands or SFX uploads. Server
            admins and bot moderators may remove content or restrict access at their discretion.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">🔑</span><span class="card-label">Access &amp; accounts</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>You sign in to the dashboard with your Discord account. What you can see and do is controlled by
            an access level set by the server's admins for each Discord server the bot is in. Access — to the
            bot, the dashboard, or both — may be changed or revoked at any time, for any reason, by a server
            admin or bot owner.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">⚙️</span><span class="card-label">Availability</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>The service is provided "as is," without warranties of any kind. We don't guarantee uptime,
            and features may change, break, or be removed without notice. We're not liable for any loss or
            damage arising from your use of, or inability to use, the bot or dashboard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">📝</span><span class="card-label">Changes to these terms</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continuing to use the bot or dashboard after an
            update means you accept the revised terms.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">🍪</span><span class="card-label">Your data</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy &amp; Cookies</a> page for details on what data we collect and
            how it's used.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-spaced">
        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">✉️</span><span class="card-label">Questions</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>If you have questions about these terms, contact a server administrator.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/pwa-register') %>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
